;table width="580"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;img src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iaRbVIO05pbM/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" alt="" width="580"/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;div style="display:none"&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;img alt="" src="https://assets.bwbx.io/images/users/iqjWHBFdfxIU/iaRbVIO05pbM/v3/pidjEfPlU1QWZop3vfGKsrX.ke8XuWirGYh1PKgEw44kE/-1x-1.png" style="width: 100%; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px;" /&gt;&lt;!--[if mso]&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;![endif]--&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;斯洛伐克政府正在推动&lt;/strong&gt;一项立法，可能会使一场具有里程碑意义的腐败审判中&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/5MAD_YbqiuzsMezr_kvRVD7TiDD4vKRvJmgRKi5SaxQ9TaTJtqvU6-lXYCMDT2agqPiGlA-AHTv72-0saDYRq01MCyWWymD7kF1P5juyE3q8ZD81QRU36PMqepILufggwI2t_OGgiyJSiWG9BmOqa8vIK3c9pJTSCnwNImrmD8bIN4dzR0p1no_Ac_H6wpUwQUruT6tKW5NABbEUsGB0Fe_SyPt3OYwVHyJlg-0xTqNgxZzMouWgNrZiQGbE_xOQTtVNPXuntX2dG_QEq-NUf12xmnb1XXiEP8cXTmLM7B3aFYjLGNL064OVdW8cRW_to_-RpaPUT8nbsi9YO872fDHqfXjab2odg4Z7qEpIVuOZtCznhiectU6rUIPfBwOinobDBZrO4kcU3T-wvjsvvt4kFlME_gxRLuJWGJhdWt5hbcdweAy7PADW-cMc0OOaPpHpUdoQkFHn9-02YN-T0RqyfShz21TxyO7D6QO00y7hY228hAolN8Teuo81wzPCaAzfMwO26sGRNcmI7679rwfYTc_CbN0ms6w60e55hMbnaQ/s18Fngs7huP7xHgTGdGHO4mmmhjfskmi/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="“炼狱”腐败案在斯洛伐克审判法治"&gt;关键证人的证词无效&lt;/a&gt;，这引发了人们对总理罗伯特·菲科领导下的法治的新担忧。此案已成为对该国机构能否追究政治精英责任的考验。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;印度外交部长苏杰生表示，印度正在努力结束俄罗斯和乌克兰之间的冲突，在航运和减少敌对行动等问题上&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/oKGJtpUFzmn_KnLAPj1s37TIag4ccEmffHcl7che9y6RhFCVnlYSYyIGFQaEIkZnxWi4uNKiSGgXHBH49MMZzfKtfdgQV4oIPuAdxW8ezicFpiN-d2Fe2k32XE7KazitpZxZGK-DYlxqMzc8mO6-YxeZc4ZYAETckr3kTy8NReTlx5XssbaG41t_Ktbpa_CoFuky7CaQQmiEgM0bqT9-gtKOWVcNpv2_ItNA502f7go_16-v7v_sXArWWVWUEZm7Xm3MZRTP778Qn4QagLTS_PfhWg_JdPyxMZ7-njdbjWtUcK2h2CJtn_ilJ7