; border-radius: 10px;" width="28" /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;中国是创新的温床，每年新增专利数量占全球近一半。其中大部分工作都在清洁技术领域，整个生态系统正在不断发展，以帮助将这些突破商业化。本周的《零》节目中，阿克沙特·拉蒂 (Akshat Rathi) 与创蓝清洁空气联盟 (Bluetech Clean Air Alliance) 主席谢东尼 (Tonny Xie) 一起参加了此次活动，该联盟是一家总部位于中国的非营利组织，致力于帮助培育下一个时代的气候初创企业。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;立即收听，并在&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/v_Fx6HK-tBfckyGedF1e_XnVEcRmymEgjkNn00TYb2kr89KRd_D1c8VQyykUzX6phke1UOCRHJji9hsvQf7y6QakiA32IUgy5wtqJJezOsgLTR9ROTrhGRFsqhNLsiqJLIc9sJRCjiiiqHuAtdzPrcPr0kKgOVSh3TyvgsBd3FpC5AoxIAi3RauQuzEEULWuDoO94PJEtrpEbQyXjKuNTYWnLWnVIRSxIb4oZBGYH-j_e02TKlI0mTyqR_auDkXrgWOLHt8O8DUFaeyW5cwr10dwAb6VB9t-vBEIUFPJEBPmXWKpU0ayV_9yQqV_ZnrUZkqF_Q/DNqLoU5sZAbUo4tn1mge3oKQqg-Z1VOG/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="零：气候竞赛"&gt;Apple&lt;/a&gt; 、 &lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/NfqVkpqr_xVSYynqPW9zmRNQGSUe1AoniYQRYxdGnRKDsXpn2nOoGfBbkoYaHlpK_nbNaP-P9FG0QYHJJno4SdH7roMAbn4RPBWyWNa1FbF1NBW1rbjkv_kcrzCRDe833CSlNxgCeevNd9CSLFyLEnuSzj7f-hRtvzCqiKxrd4DOLY7LXASgcL4uGmwTFe7PM3kDzq0HIQ0aL4dnfraWF8ld6mg0m7_hIFjyL3MDIvVQKHoI_Ul0Q6G1PM5x_bqun9dYCAXy7ExRgJ38R7VBf2_dBLcu1lBWynOYilYrtEeH_8nNCUXLgpYYdRGJg4BgSBmS5eRo0LXII3rA4YKk3-NoHDuo/owLkg-y-SCxzAwbfRqFXa1izwgU5EwGg/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="零：气候竞赛"&gt;Spotify&lt;/a&gt;或&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/s/c/Mbzdcx3uoALedm0Exn8mX4SL9Tn5MXzbBO5cYg8rPgi9noI0JEjwg3pcu7vDnDeqDfts-QYL0ip3vcZF9KVpCZavA32pYSIbgo_bYPL0rgrK1rctV-_TyrVFcxxbS0gt5DpuhWHhPOyNJMlxBqomn9goxxTIURPWre30JRi9PabSSs438yEKQJJbRcFiwAcGjskgXJ5uRhOvXy3vVAxMR004MD-YfA53y_LM75y6ZzCmiCIjDD7bGvHYKfO-iQ1fkd3XEMaw-uWkjcDoH4l0de1Eyu4FdujmNwWka8R5Wu5UhjQHJfEVG-OINzJTXZUqgVaNga06YYvItMfZz6--5zAjM19A/qtqjzoG_uq4PQtVOvqpsaYbcWurH9QV5/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; col